*.md
!packages/**/*.md
# In step with .gitignore, which excludes these from the tree but not from
# the build context. A swarm worktree under .swarm is a whole copy of this
# repo and would be sent to the daemon on every build; a developer .env
# beside a package would be copied into the build stage by
# `COPY packages ./packages`, even though the root COPY list is explicit and
# nothing but dist/ and the tapes reaches the final image.
.swarm
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
